## COMMUNICATION

**When unsure, use DECISION FORMAT:**

```
Problem A: [decision needed]
  A1. [option] — pros / cons
  A2. [option] — pros / cons ← recommended

User replies: a2
```

**Never assume or guess.**

---

## WHEN HITTING LIMITS

```bash
# 1. Update .ai_context.md with WIP status
# 2. Fill MEMORY_SNAPSHOT_TEMPLATE.md
# 3. Commit + push
# 4. Tell user "Ліміти вичерпано"
```

---

## CRITICAL REMINDERS

1. Read `.ai_context.md` at session start
2. Read `strategy.md` before coding
3. Reference `knowledge_base/` constantly
4. Write tests alongside code
5. Inject caveats on metrics
6. Output Text-First DOM (JSON + Markdown)
7. Ask if unsure (DECISION FORMAT)
8. Update `.ai_context.md` before limits hit

